"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_eunhwa_01_33","text":"Anyway, welcome to life as livestock.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_eunhwa_01_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"eunhwa","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_eunhwa_01_34","text":"The one beside, where are you from?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_eunhwa_01_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"grayowl","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_eunhwa_01_35","text":"I'm from the Outer Rim, Instructor.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_eunhwa_01_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"eunhwa","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_eunhwa_01_36","text":"... There are no ups and downs in life.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_eunhwa_01_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"eunhwa","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_eunhwa_01_37","text":"Being at the bottom from birth to death.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_eunhwa_01_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"eunhwa","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_eunhwa_01_38","text":"But even though you are less than human, you can be useful as a weapon.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_eunhwa_01_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"eunhwa","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_eunhwa_01_39","text":"Useful as a tool to regain control of the surface.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_eunhwa_01_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"eunhwa","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_eunhwa_01_40","text":"Try to be worthy at least once before you die.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_eunhwa_01_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"grayowl","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_eunhwa_01_41","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_eunhwa_01_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"eunhwa","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_eunhwa_01_42","text":"Respond.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_eunhwa_01_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"grayowl","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_eunhwa_01_43","text":"Yes, Instructor!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["ingrid"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_eunhwa_01_44","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_eunhwa_01_44","text":"Why go to such an extent?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_eunhwa_01_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"ingrid","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_eunhwa_01_45","text":"... It's the process so that they adapt quickly.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_eunhwa_01_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"ingrid","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_eunhwa_01_46","text":"A newly made Nikke knows in their head that they are a weapon,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_eunhwa_01_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"ingrid","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_eunhwa_01_47","text":"but their heart might not agree.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_eunhwa_01_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"ingrid","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_eunhwa_01_48","text":"So we need to use this method to sever all ties to their past.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_eunhwa_01_49","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_eunhwa_01_49","text":"I don't think it's necessary to sever their past.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_eunhwa_01_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"ingrid","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_eunhwa_01_50","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_eunhwa_01_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"ingrid","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_eunhwa_01_51","text":"I wish we had more people that think like you,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_eunhwa_01_52","type":"Speech","speaker":"ingrid","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_eunhwa_01_52","text":"but unfortunately, the reality says otherwise.\nSo we are stuck with this method.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_eunhwa_01_53","type":"Speech","speaker":"ingrid","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_eunhwa_01_53","text":"I ask for your support going forward, Eunhwa.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_eunhwa_01_54","type":"Speech","speaker":"ingrid","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_eunhwa_01_54","text":"In here, your task is to be a human commander.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_eunhwa_01_55","type":"Speech","speaker":"ingrid","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_eunhwa_01_55","text":"Just to exist and reign might be fulfilling your role but,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_eunhwa_01_56","type":"Speech","speaker":"ingrid","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_eunhwa_01_56","text":"I don't think you will be satisfied with just that.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_eunhwa_01_57","type":"Speech","speaker":"ingrid","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_eunhwa_01_57","text":"As an assistant instructor, feel free to ask me anything.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_eunhwa_01_58","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_eunhwa_01_58","text":"What's the training schedule?","jump":"d_nikke_eunhwa_01_60","exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_eunhwa_01_59","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_eunhwa_01_59","text":"Why did you call for me to be the assistant instructor?","jump":"d_nikke_eunhwa_01_79","exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_eunhwa_01_60","type":"Speech","speaker":"ingrid","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_eunhwa_01_60","text":"You have a s